---
# THE NAME IS LOAD-BEARING. prowlarr's seeded database stores the FlareSolverr URL as
# `http://flaresolverr:8191`, which was the Compose service key. A Service called anything else
# leaves prowlarr reporting an ordinary connection failure against every Cloudflare-protected
# indexer — the same class of trap as freshrss's feed-cache.
{{ service('flaresolverr', prowlarr_k8s_flaresolverr_port) -}}
